"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $2,575M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 44.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.43"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":517.83,"default_fair_val":517.83,"premium_pct":-23.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":15.2,"pe_forward":13.4,"pb_trailing":2.1,"pb_forward":1.9,"div_yield":0.94,"ps_ratio":3.8,"fcf_to_ev":4.25,"fcf_to_mcap":6.55,"liab_to_assets":44.2,"cash_to_assets":0.9,"current_ratio":0.43,"roe":13.5,"roa":7.5,"moat":{"ticker":"ROP","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Roper Technologies 的品牌定價權主要體現在其利基市場的領導地位和高度專業化的軟體解決方案上。公司透過收購和整合，在特定行業建立了強大的品牌聲譽，客戶因其產品的專業性和可靠性而願意支付溢價。然而，與消費品牌不同，其品牌影響力主要局限於 B2B 領域，定價權的強度取決於其產品在客戶營運中的不可或缺性。","comment_en":"Roper Technologies derives its brand pricing power primarily from its leadership in niche markets and highly specialized software solutions. Through acquisitions and integration, the company has built a strong reputation within specific industries, allowing customers to pay a premium for its products' expertise and reliability. Unlike consumer brands, its brand influence is largely confined to the B2B sector, and pricing power strength depends on the indispensability of its products to customer operations."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Roper 的部分軟體產品可能擁有專利保護，但其核心競爭力更多來自於對特定行業流程的深刻理解和軟體整合能力，而非單純的專利壁壘。監管環境對其影響相對較小，因為其產品多為輔助性工具，而非直接受嚴格監管的關鍵系統。專利和特許權的保護作用有限，不足以構成其主要的護城河。","comment_en":"While some of Roper's software products may benefit from patent protection, its core competitive advantage stems more from its deep understanding of specific industry processes and software integration capabilities rather than purely patent-based barriers. Regulatory environments have a relatively minor impact, as its products are mostly auxiliary tools rather than critical, directly regulated systems. The protection offered by patents and licenses is limited and does not constitute its primary moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Roper 的軟體解決方案通常深度整合到客戶的關鍵業務流程中，涉及複雜的數據遷移、系統配置和員工培訓。一旦客戶採用了 Roper 的系統，轉換到競爭對手的成本將非常高昂，不僅涉及直接的財務支出，還包括潛在的營運中斷風險和學習曲線。這種高轉換成本是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Roper's software solutions are typically deeply integrated into clients' critical business processes, involving complex data migration, system configuration, and employee training. Once a customer adopts Roper's systems, the cost of switching to a competitor is prohibitively high, encompassing not only direct financial expenses but also potential operational disruption risks and learning curves. These high switching costs represent a significant moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Roper 的業務模式主要聚焦於為特定行業提供專業軟體和解決方案，其產品的價值主要體現在單一客戶的使用效率和效果上，而非通過用戶間的互動來增強價值。因此，網絡效應在其大部分業務中並不明顯，這不是其主要的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Roper's business model primarily focuses on providing specialized software and solutions for specific industries. The value of its products is mainly derived from the efficiency and effectiveness for individual clients, rather than enhancing value through user interactions. Consequently, network effects are not prominent in most of its operations and do not serve as a primary competitive barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Roper 在其運營的利基市場中，透過持續的收購整合，實現了一定的規模經濟效益。這有助於降低研發、銷售和管理成本，並在採購和供應鏈方面獲得優勢。然而，相較於大型軟體公司，其規模優勢相對有限，且其分散的業務組合可能限制了單一業務線的規模效應。","comment_en":"Through continuous acquisition and integration in its niche markets, Roper has achieved certain economies of scale. This helps reduce R&D, sales, and administrative costs and provides advantages in procurement and supply chains. However, compared to large software conglomerates, its scale advantage is relatively limited, and its diversified business portfolio may restrict the scale effects within individual business lines."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Roper 的業務遍及全球，但其競爭優勢並非來自於獨特的地理位置或資產，而是其在特定行業的深耕和專業知識。雖然其全球佈局有助於分散風險和開拓市場，但並未形成顯著的地理壁壘。其核心價值在於軟體和服務，而非實體資產。","comment_en":"Roper operates globally, but its competitive advantage does not stem from unique geographical locations or assets, but rather from its deep expertise and specialization within specific industries. While its global presence helps diversify risks and expand markets, it does not create a significant geographical barrier. Its core value lies in software and services, not tangible assets."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Roper 以其卓越的營運效率和精實的管理風格著稱，尤其是在收購整合方面。公司擅長識別、收購並有效整合具有潛在價值的企業，並通過精簡流程、優化資源配置來提升盈利能力。這種持續的營運優化能力是其重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Roper is known for its exceptional operational efficiency and lean management style, particularly in acquisition integration. The company excels at identifying, acquiring, and effectively integrating businesses with latent value, enhancing profitability through streamlined processes and optimized resource allocation. This sustained operational optimization capability is a significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Roper 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了卓越的智慧和紀律。公司歷史上成功地透過精準的收購來擴張業務、提升價值，並在適當時機回購股票或支付股息。其對高回報機會的專注以及對資本運用的審慎態度，是其長期價值創造的關鍵。","comment_en":"Roper's management demonstrates exceptional wisdom and discipline in capital allocation. The company has a history of successfully expanding its business and enhancing value through precise acquisitions, and judiciously repurchasing shares or paying dividends when appropriate. Its focus on high-return opportunities and prudent approach to capital deployment are key to its long-term value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"由於 Roper 的軟體解決方案深度嵌入客戶的營運流程，且轉換成本高昂，客戶黏著度極高。一旦客戶建立起對 Roper 產品的依賴，便很難轉向其他供應商。這種高客戶留存率為公司帶來了穩定且可預測的經常性收入，是其堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Due to the deep integration of Roper's software solutions into client operational workflows and the high switching costs involved, customer retention is extremely high. Once clients establish a reliance on Roper's products, it becomes difficult to switch to other vendors. This high customer retention rate provides the company with stable and predictable recurring revenue, forming a robust moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Roper 的業務模式具有相當的持久性，其利基市場的專業軟體解決方案需求穩定，且不易受到短期市場波動的劇烈影響。透過持續的收購和整合，公司能夠不斷適應市場變化並擴大其護城河。然而，科技行業的快速變革仍是潛在的長期風險。","comment_en":"Roper's business model exhibits considerable durability. The demand for its specialized software solutions in niche markets is stable and not significantly affected by short-term market fluctuations. Through continuous acquisitions and integration, the company can adapt to market changes and broaden its moat. However, the rapid pace of technological change remains a potential long-term risk."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Roper Technologies 的護城河主要由其高轉換成本、卓越的營運效率和精準的資本配置所構成，形成了一種類似「收費橋」的商業模式。公司透過收購整合，在特定利基市場建立了難以取代的地位，客戶因深度整合和高昂轉換成本而高度黏著。雖然其品牌定價權和規模經濟效益相對有限，網絡效應幾乎不存在，但其持續優化營運和明智配置資本的能力，為其帶來了穩定的經常性收入和持久的競爭優勢。其護城河堅固，但需留意科技變革的潛在威脅。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Roper Technologies' moat is primarily built upon high switching costs, exceptional operational efficiency, and astute capital allocation, creating a 'toll bridge'-like business model. Through strategic acquisitions and integration, the company has secured an indispensable position in specific niche markets, fostering high customer stickiness due to deep integration and prohibitive switching costs. While its brand pricing power and economies of scale are relatively moderate, and network effects are minimal, its ability to continuously optimize operations and wisely deploy capital generates stable recurring revenue and enduring competitive advantages. The moat is robust, though potential technological disruption warrants attention.","evidenceHash":"11e73ef02d258218ec2e40ba0c82875b907b0ed9a9a5a70d171fa7955f438011","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"f6b4c3988b358e7024dd0e1c580f49055f632e9f7c1e8235cdd4e5122192660d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"f6b4c3988b358e7024dd0e1c580f49055f632e9f7c1e8235cdd4e5122192660d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ROP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ROP.png","website":"https://www.ropertech.com","ceo":"Laurence Neil Hunn","full_time_employees":"19400","description":"Roper Technologies, Inc., established in 1981 and based in Sarasota, Florida (formerly known as Roper Industries, Inc. until 2015), operates as a diversified technology company. It specializes in developing and delivering advanced software solutions alongside highly engineered products for a wide range of industries. Its extensive software portfolio includes enterprise and financial management systems, cloud-based analytics for sectors like insurance and healthcare, campus and supply chain management tools, and specialized applications for areas such as foodservice, visual effects, and data collaboration. Complementing this, Roper designs and manufactures a diverse array of engineered products, encompassing precision testing instruments for materials like rubber and plastic, medical devices (such as ultrasound accessories), flow and control components (including valves, pumps, and meters), automated dispensing and monitoring equipment (like leak detection and vibration monitoring systems), and various sensors for industrial and utility applications.","description_en":"Roper Technologies, Inc., established in 1981 and based in Sarasota, Florida (formerly known as Roper Industries, Inc. until 2015), operates as a diversified technology company. It specializes in developing and delivering advanced software solutions alongside highly engineered products for a wide range of industries. Its extensive software portfolio includes enterprise and financial management systems, cloud-based analytics for sectors like insurance and healthcare, campus and supply chain management tools, and specialized applications for areas such as foodservice, visual effects, and data collaboration. Complementing this, Roper designs and manufactures a diverse array of engineered products, encompassing precision testing instruments for materials like rubber and plastic, medical devices (such as ultrasound accessories), flow and control components (including valves, pumps, and meters), automated dispensing and monitoring equipment (like leak detection and vibration monitoring systems), and various sensors for industrial and utility applications.","description_zh":"**Roper Technologies, Inc. (ROP) 業務營運分析**\n\nRoper Technologies, Inc. (ROP) 是一家多元化的科技公司，專注於為廣泛產業提供先進軟體解決方案與高度工程化的產品。其軟體業務涵蓋企業與財務管理系統、保險及醫療保健等領域的雲端分析、校園與供應鏈管理工具，以及餐飲服務、視覺特效和資料協作等專業應用。\n\n在工程化產品方面，ROP 設計並製造多樣化的精密儀器，包括橡膠與塑膠等材料的測試儀器、醫療設備（如超音波配件）、流體與控制元件（如閥門、泵浦、流量計）、自動化配給與監控設備（如滲漏偵測與振動監測系統），以及用於工業與公用事業的各式感測器。\n\nROP 的營運模式著重於透過收購與整合，持續擴展其在特定利基市場的領導地位，並透過其分散式的營運架構，賦予旗下各事業單位高度的自主性，以快速回應市場變化並推動創新。","address":"6901 Professional Parkway","city":"Sarasota","state":"FL","zip":"34240","country":"US","phone":"941 556 2601","full_address":"6901 Professional Parkway, Sarasota, FL 34240, US","range_52w":"305.96-483.36","year_high":483.36,"year_low":305.96,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":305.96,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Dubey Abhijit","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":13,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Dubey Abhijit","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":619,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Dubey Abhijit","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Joyce Thomas Patrick JR","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":78,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"ESTEVES IRENE M","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":78,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"ARCHAMBEAU SHELLYE L","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":84,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"Stipancich John K","title":"officer: EVP, Chief Legal Officer & Sec","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2000,"price":228.84,"total_val":0.46},{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"Stipancich John K","title":"officer: EVP, Chief Legal Officer & Sec","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2000,"price":379.05,"total_val":0.76},{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"Stipancich John K","title":"officer: EVP, Chief Legal Officer & Sec","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2000,"price":228.84,"total_val":0.46},{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"WALLMAN RICHARD F","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6434,"price":361,"total_val":2.32}],"stock_splits":[{"date":"2005-08-29","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1997-08-04","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1993-09-21","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實